  Stop_Loss   = sweep-day LOW
  Universe    = price >= 10 USD, 20d avg volume >= 100k

  📋 SCORE (0-100)
  Base 40 + wick length (0-20) + body ratio (0-15) + both MAs swept (10)
  + close near the high (0-10) + volume >= 1.5x avg (5); -10 if stop risk > 12%
